# Secret and private trading strategies.
# Everything in strat/ is ignored EXCEPT the allowlisted public-safe
# built-ins below (base class + reconstructed textbook strategies), so the
# app can be built and run from a fresh clone. Any other file dropped into
# strat/ stays private. (strat/* rather than strat/ because a directory
# ignore cannot be negated per-file.)
strat/*
!strat/__init__.py
!strat/base.py
!strat/buy_and_hold.py
!strat/sma_crossover.py
!strat/ema_crossover.py
!strat/rsi_mean_reversion.py
!strat/bollinger_bands.py
!strat/macd.py
!strat/genetic_programming.py
!strat/rs_breakout.py
user_strategies/
*secret*
*private*
secret_strats/
private_strats/
strat/secret_*
strat/private_*
strat/secret/
strat/private/

# Backtest Outputs
output/
